{
  "name": "Welcome Sequence — Opt-in confirmado → Automation Brevo",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Flujo: contacto confirmado → secuencia de bienvenida en Brevo\n**Trigger:** Webhook de Brevo — evento 'opt_in_confirmed' (o evento personalizado desde Supabase)\n\n**Pasos:**\n- 1. Recibe confirmación de opt-in de Brevo\n- 2. Actualiza status='confirmed' en Supabase\n- 3. Registra evento opt_in_confirmed en email_events\n- 4. Añade el contacto a la automation de bienvenida en Brevo\n- 5. Registra el inicio de la secuencia en el campo in_active_sequence de contacts\n\n**Notas:**\n- La automation en Brevo se configura manualmente con los templates de emails/templates/.\n- Este flujo n8n solo gestiona el trigger inicial y la actualización de estado en Supabase.\n- Si el cliente tiene WhatsApp OS activo, notificar también al CRM de WhatsApp vía webhook.\n\n**Automation Brevo — Welcome Sequence:**\n- 0 min → WelcomeEmail — entrega del lead magnet\n- 2 days → NurturingEmail — email 1 (problema común)\n- 5 days → NurturingEmail — email 2 (recurso)\n- 10 days → NurturingEmail — email 3 (caso real)\nSalidas: El contacto reserva una llamada (webhook de Calendly/Cal.com); El contacto responde al email (manual — pausar secuencia); El contacto se da de baja",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 1160,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-doc",
      "name": "Documentación",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "brevo-events"
      },
      "id": "brevo-optin-webhook",
      "name": "Webhook — Brevo opt_in_confirmed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond1",
              "leftValue": "={{$json.event}}",
              "rightValue": "opt_in_confirmed",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "filter-optin-event",
      "name": "Filter — Solo procesar opt_in_confirmed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        460,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "tableId": "contacts",
        "filterType": "string",
        "filterString": "client_id=eq.{{$env.CLIENT_ID}}&email=eq.{{$json.email}}"
      },
      "id": "update-contact-confirmed",
      "name": "Supabase — Actualizar status=confirmed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        680,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "create",
        "tableId": "email_events",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            {
              "fieldId": "client_id",
              "fieldValue": "={{$env.CLIENT_ID}}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "email",
              "fieldValue": "={{$json.email}}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "event_type",
              "fieldValue": "opt_in_confirmed"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "log-confirmed-event",
      "name": "Supabase — Registrar evento opt_in_confirmed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        900,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.brevo.com/v3/contacts/doubleOptinConfirmation",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "api-key",
              "value": "={{$env.BREVO_API_KEY}}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "trigger-brevo-automation",
      "name": "Brevo — Añadir a automation Welcome Sequence",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1120,
        300
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook — Brevo opt_in_confirmed": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Filter — Solo procesar opt_in_confirmed",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Filter — Solo procesar opt_in_confirmed": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Supabase — Actualizar status=confirmed",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Supabase — Actualizar status=confirmed": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Supabase — Registrar evento opt_in_confirmed",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Supabase — Registrar evento opt_in_confirmed": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Brevo — Añadir a automation Welcome Sequence",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}
